    "parsed_response": {
      "turns": [
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Good morning, Elaine, Marcus Lim here. Thanks for making time for the call. Are you somewhere comfortable to talk? Last time you mentioned getting the garden sorted out; how has that been going?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Morning, Marcus. Yes, I'm at home, so it's quiet enough. The garden is coming along nicely. I've put the herbs near the kitchen, though the basil seems to need more attention than everything else."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Sounds like a nice project. Before we get into today's discussion, please give me your FIN and date of birth for the identification step."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_013]] [[EV_014]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you, Elaine. I'll listen while you set out what you called about."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_015]] [[EV_019]] [[EV_016]] [[EV_017]] [[EV_018]] [[EV_020]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_001]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thanks. Please keep the conversation straightforward. I've got another appointment later, but there's no need to rush through the paperwork."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_002]] [[EV_003]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_004]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_005]] [[EV_006]] [[EV_007]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_008]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "[[EV_009]] [[EV_012]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Before we finish, I'd also like to sort out the routine correspondence. The envelopes tend to pile up on my desk."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "We can cover that shortly. [[EV_010]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "[[EV_011]]"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Now, on the correspondence, would you prefer routine account documents electronically or by post? We can look at your communication preferences separately from anything else discussed today."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Electronically, please. I prefer to check things myself when I'm home rather than have someone at the office handling envelopes. A notification is useful, but I don't need a separate courtesy call."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "I'll note that preference and check the available settings. You can also review them in the app. If anything needs a separate administrative step, I'll let you know."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Okay, that suits me. I'll have a look after my appointment. Then hopefully I can get back to the garden before the rain comes."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "EMPLOYEE",
          "text": "Thank you for your time, Elaine. Enjoy the rest of your day, and good luck with the basil."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "CLIENT",
          "text": "Thanks, Marcus. Have a good day too. Bye."
        }
      ]
